#   {field|filter|filter:arg}   a value, e.g. {cost.total_cost_usd|money}
#   <red> <110> <#ff8800> <bold dim> <bg:236> </>   colors (</> resets)
#   <heat:field:50:80>          green / yellow / red by that field's value

